  <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">관련: <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/ko/brokerage-calculator/">중개보수 계산기</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/ko/self-registration-cost-calculator/">셀프등기 비용</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/ko/pro-office/#KR/realty">실무 오피스 부동산실</a></p>
